comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T19:42:44.895Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: searched all 2,136 items for linked-test context none, source-workspace opt-out, file governance, coverage, and validation. Reused pm-vrsn as canonical implemented lineage; no existing item covers an explicit no-source-workspace mode. Discovered while closing PR #777 review evidence; direct coverage passed all 6,428 tests at 100/100/100/100, while two linked attempts deterministically failed validate file-scan and merge-receipt fixtures because execution_context retained the source workspace."
